/v1/","context":{"app_id":4815980,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-4815980","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T09:49:55Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5020440","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4815980-1847286114028475","game_id":"steam-4815980","kind":"announcement","title":"New Community Thread: Tips to Get Started","summary":"The game can be hard if you are new, and getting your first mining operation moving is no easy task! Our new Tips to Get Started community thread is now live to help you get going! It covers practical ways to earn credits faster and make those first upgrades count: dust purity, processor queue size, 10-second record bonuses, borrowing, the Meteor Miner, cargo capacity and automated deliveries. 👉 Read the tips and join the discussion Already found your feet? Add a tip of your own! Tell us which u","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T11:13:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028475","verified_at":"2026-10-21T13:28:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4815980-1846651706694750","game_id":"steam-4815980","kind":"announcement","title":"Two Leaderboards. Two Winners. Win the Full Game!","summary":"Can you finish Steam Next Fest at the top? To celebrate Return to Planet Zoveka taking part in Steam Next Fest, I'm giving away two copies of the full game—one for each of our two leaderboard challenges! Download the free demo, find your strategy, and see how far you can push it. DUST RUSH CHAMPION Herd, merge, and collect your way to the highest score on the demo's Dust Rush leaderboard. Make every second count! DEMO CAMPAIGN CHAMPION Plan your upgrades, build momentum, and record the fastest c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T10:58:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694750","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4815980-1846651706691424","game_id":"steam-4815980","kind":"announcement","title":"We're in Steam Next Fest! Come Play the Demo","summary":"How much can you build from a handful of cosmic dust? An expanding mining operation? A way home for a displaced family? Come find out! Return to Planet Zoveka is taking part in Steam Next Fest, 19–26 October! The free demo is ready for you to jump in, experiment, and make a little cosmic chaos of your own. I'm Jaco, the developer behind the game. This is a big moment for me, and I'd love you to be part of it. Play the demo. Find your flow. Herd and merge drifting dust, upgrade the family mining ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691424","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4815980-1845383656385695","game_id":"steam-4815980","kind":"announcement","title":"We’re getting ready for launch!","summary":"It’s getting close, and I can’t wait to share this next chapter of Return to Planet Zoveka with you! We’re joining Steam Next Fest from 19–26 October! Come try the demo, check in, and say hi. I’d love to hear how your adventure is going. Behind the scenes, we’re putting the final polishing touches on the game. Working with local artists to fine-tune the graphics and music has been an amazing part of this journey. Seeing everything come together has made me even more excited for you to experience","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T10:04:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656385695","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4815980-1840944183788111","game_id":"steam-4815980","kind":"announcement","title":"The Pre-Release Demo Is Now Playable!","summary":"The free pre-release demo for Return to Planet Zoveka is now playable on Steam.It is a generous early-to-mid-game slice: herd and merge cosmic dust, expand the family mining operation, unlock upgrades, and start automating. The Dust Rush Challenge Arcade mode is fully playable, too.The demo is still developing, and your input will help guide the road to release. Tell us what is fun, unclear, too slow, or missing—including mechanics, balance, quality-of-life, and accessibility ideas. We cannot pr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-18T07:59:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183788111","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4815980-1839676055883199","game_id":"steam-4815980","kind":"announcement","title":"Celebrating the Artists and Musicians Behind Return to Planet Zoveka","summary":"Creating the world of Return to Planet Zoveka is a collaborative effort, and we have been fortunate to work with a wonderfully talented group of visual artists and musicians.Bringing a game to life takes far more than ideas and code. Its worlds need atmosphere and identity, its characters need personality, and its music needs to capture the emotion and energy of the experience. Skilled artists and musicians transform those individual elements into something players can see, hear, and connect wit","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-29T17:46:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055883199","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4815980-1839041357035675","game_id":"steam-4815980","kind":"announcement","title":"Our Public Demo Is Almost Ready!","summary":"We’re excited to share that the public demo for Return to Planet Zoveka is progressing well and is almost ready!We’re incredibly proud of what we’re putting together, and we can’t wait for you to experience it.Our current target is to make the public pre-release demo available around during August 2026. As we continue with final polishing and testing, this timing may shift slightly.Watch this space for more updates and news as we get closer. We’re excited to welcome you to Planet Zoveka soon!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-27T13:13:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357035675","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4815980-1836506165576259","game_id":"steam-4815980","kind":"announcement","title":"Invantage Studios Is Now On YouTube","summary":"Hello from sunny South Africa!We have opened the new Invantage Studios YouTube channel you can find here:This will be our home for regular video updates around Return to Planet Zoveka: gameplay captures, development progress, trailer clips, feature spotlights, and the occasional look behind the scenes as the game keeps growing.If you would like to follow the project in motion, please check in there regularly and subscribe. It helps us a lot at this stage, and it gives us a good place to share mo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-06T15:49:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165576259","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4815980-1835871199303558","game_id":"steam-4815980","kind":"announcement","title":"The Fun Part You Don’t See: Optimising Return to Planet Zoveka","summary":"Most players will never notice the quiet little systems running underneath Return to Planet Zoveka, keeping the game fun and smooth.When the game is running well, you should be thinking about space dust mining and surviving the strange little mess we have left for you to solve. You should not be thinking, “Ah yes, excellent memory management.”But we are thinking about it. A lot.At Invantage, we usually spend our days building software, data systems, automations, payment flows, reporting tools, a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-18T09:27:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199303558","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4815980-1835236783560652","game_id":"steam-4815980","kind":"announcement","title":"Return to Planet Zoveka Steam Store Page Is Live","summary":"Hi everyone,Exciting times: the Steam store page for Return to Planet Zoveka is now live.This is a big step for the project, and we are really happy to finally start sharing more of what the game is becoming. Return to Planet Zoveka now has a Steam store page! :-)We are currently working hard on capturing in-game screen recordings so you can see more of the actual gameplay in motion. Those will be posted soon.The next big milestone is a playable demo, which we are aiming to have ready during Jul","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-11T14:49:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783560652","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4815980":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:26:22Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:26:21Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4815980":"2026-10-26T04:26:22Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4815980":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:26:21Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:26:21Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5020440":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:26:22Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:26:22Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4815980","app_id":4815980,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:59Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"1801820219ee9720283db53ce0d0982dd44c0f3504df6969f2dc48d0e08f7e47","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"물리 기반 2D 인크리멘털 우주 채굴 시뮬레이션입니다. 가족을 도와 우주 먼지를 모으고, 생산을 자동화하고, 연구를 해금하며, 물려받은 단 하나의 우주 정거장을 거대한 사업으로 키우세요. Zoveka를 치유하는 편안하고 다채로운 여정을 즐기세요.","publishers":[{"name":"Invantage Studios","creator_clan_account_id":46150341}],"developers":[{"name":"Invantage Studios","creator_clan_account_id":46150341}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1793257200,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Gameplay trailer Master Sep 2026","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1788112751","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4815980/721514236/6ce9df1b4e692cea37282b1893528e92d6250240/1788110427/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"4815980/721514236/6ce9df1b4e692cea37282b1893528e92d6250240/1788110427/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/